---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro'

const title = 'Disclaimer | Zyankov.eu'
const description = 'What the calculators, estimates, articles and word lists on Zyankov.eu can and cannot tell you: general information, not professional, legal or financial advice.'
const jsonLd = {
  '@type': 'WebPage',
  dateModified: '2026-11-15',
}
---

<PageLayout title={title} description={description} path="/disclaimer/" lang="en" alternates={{ en: '/disclaimer/', bg: '/bg/otkaz-ot-otgovornost/' }} noAds={true} project="hub" jsonLd={jsonLd}>
      <p class="eyebrow">Important information</p>
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: November 15, 2026</p>
      <p class="intro">
        The tools and articles on Zyankov.eu provide general information for planning, learning and play. Please read the limitations below before relying on a result.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>No professional advice</h2>
        <p>Nothing on this site is professional, engineering, legal, tax or financial advice. Results depend on the values and assumptions you enter, and no tool can account for every product, situation or rule.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Calculator estimates</h2>
        <p>The results of the calculators on Zyankov.eu, including BuildCalc, are arithmetic estimates based on the values you enter and on the rates and coefficients listed under each calculator. Material density, coverage, site conditions, cutting, waste and packaging vary, and energy prices, tariffs, appliance use, tax rates, interest rates and exchange rates change. Each calculator shows its formula, its sources and the date they were last checked; verify results against those sources, with product documentation, suppliers, the competent authority and qualified professionals.</p>
        <p>Concrete volume estimates do not establish structural adequacy or building-code compliance. The calculators do not guarantee that an estimate will match the quantity you need or the price you are charged. Confirm quantities, delivery terms and project requirements before you order or start work.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Articles</h2>
        <p>The articles explain how the tools work and use worked examples. They are general information, they reflect the sources and figures available on the date shown, and they are not advice for your specific situation.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Letterwell word lists</h2>
        <p>Letterwell searches openly licensed English and Bulgarian word lists. They can include or omit words differently from official game dictionaries, and the scores follow common letter values that some editions change. Check the rules and dictionary of the game you are playing.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2>
        <p>The content is checked carefully, but errors are possible and the tools may change or be unavailable. Nothing in this disclaimer limits rights that cannot be limited under applicable law. The <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a> apply to the whole site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Ads and external links</h2>
        <p>The site is set up for Google AdSense and links to other websites. Zyankov.eu does not control the content of ads, if any are shown, or of external sites. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for how advertising works.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Found a mistake? Email <a href="mailto:hello@zyankov.eu">hello@zyankov.eu</a> with the page and a short description.</p>
      </section>
</PageLayout>
